swimlaneDiagram
title IT Purchase Approval Flow (Feature Showcase)

lane requester "Requester"
lane approver "Approver"
lane finance "Finance"
lane it "IT"

node start in requester [start/end] "Start"
node submit in requester process "Submit Purchase Request"
node approved in approver decision "Manager Approved?"
node budget in finance subprocess "Budget Check"
node po in finance document "Create PO"
node reserve in it data "Reserve Equipment"
node fulfill in it process "Procure & Fulfill"
node end in requester [start/end] "End"

connect start --> submit
connect submit --> approved
connect approved -->|Yes| budget
connect approved -->|No| submit
connect budget -->|Pass| po
connect budget -->|Fail| submit
connect po --> reserve
connect reserve --> fulfill
connect fulfill --> end
